map.[ab] - bobulova zhouba.event.0.descr:
    Greetings to all HOMM fans. This map was made for my mate Bobula, who kept boasting about how brilliant he was at Heroes. So if it seems too hard, that is a good thing. If you happen to like it and want to praise or criticise me, you can email {pard.p@email.cz} or visit Mageo's {gamesy} section and the {HOMM1&2&3&4} discussion board. Naturally, I appear on the map as {Pardal}, and on Mageo under the nickname {Pheca}. Some of my other mates also appear on the map, just so you do not wonder about them.
    Now I would like to greet a few people, namely: 
    - everyone from {Mageo} on the discussion board mentioned above (Kal Kal, Gremlin, Leki, Erina, ...)
    - all the addicts from the MUD {Lost in Time} (if you happen to meet {Pard}, that is me ;-). If anyone happens not to know what {LiT} is, take a look at {http://lit.sh.cvut.cz}
    - and greetings to all veterans of the {8-bit} era, especially {Spectrum fans}

    Well, I have finished babbling, so stop shaking your heads at this utter nonsense and start playing! - {Pardal the Great}

P.S. Set the difficulty to at least {hard}, because on normal the computer plays like some halfwit from Bohnice.

map.[ab] - den nezávislosti.event.4.desc:
You have received a short message reading:

{"You, {who {have {dared {to {stand {against {us, shall die!"}

/It did not arrive on a mobile phone. A messenger ran up with it, just for the record.../

map.[ab] - honza 2:5.guards.29.47.0.mess:
A stablehand approaches from the stables, looking plainly feeble-minded.
{Ueee hue bleeeeh...}
You understand perfectly that he wants to feed and exchange your horse.

map.[ab] - honza 2:5.guards.34.60.0.mess:
{"At last!"} comes a sudden voice from beside a bush.
{"I was beginning to think you would never come."}
Another halfling tells you to continue south to the Valley of White Cliffs. There you will find their chief and the sword.

map.[ab] - honza 2:5.guards.40.46.0.mess:
{"Heeey! You there!"}
You look around in confusion and spot another halfling.
{"If my friend sent you, you are in the right {place."}
You learn that if you want the sword, you must continue to the Dwarven Treasury south of here. Another member of their guild will await you south of its entrance.

map.[ab] - honza 2:7.guards.34.83.0.mess:
Suddenly, a horde of wolf-riding goblins rushes out of the nearby forest. Their leader stops his wolf a few feet before you and says: "What you give us if we let you pass?"
{"This, you bastard!"}
In reply, you draw your sword in a flash. Its blade gleams in the sunlight and plunges hungrily into the scoundrel's chest. The startled goblin tries to say something, but his words become a single gurgling sigh that even his followers cannot understand. Seized by fear, the wolf tucks its tail between its legs and races away. The other goblins stand stunned for a moment by their commander's sudden death. Then they recover and attack.

map.[ab] - honza 2:7.guards.86.69.0.mess:
Suddenly, a horde of wolf-riding goblins rushes out of the nearby forest. Their leader stops his wolf a few feet before you and says: "What you give us if we let you pass?"
