In reply, you draw your sword in a flash. Its blade gleams in the sunlight and plunges hungrily into the scoundrel's chest. The startled goblin tries to say something, but his words become a single gurgling sigh that even his followers cannot understand. Seized by fear, the wolf tucks its tail between its legs and races away. The other goblins stand stunned for a moment by their commander's sudden death. Then they recover and attack.

Terron has laid a dreadful curse upon you. A terrible plague ravages your crops, livestock, and towns...
The damage is beyond reckoning.

