map.[sod] - legenda ostrovniho kralovstv:
Dear player, if you did not receive a message just beyond the teleporter (four movement squares back), another player got here before you. That leaves you with only three options:

{1. Restart the game (recommended)}
{2. Cheats (I really... dislike those!)}
{3. Dismiss this as the product of a sick mind and delete the map :-(}

I hope you need choose none of these options. But if you must, I sincerely hope you choose the first. The map's author wishes you good luck.
{mailto:broono@centrum.cz}

{Ambush!}
On a real map, you may find that stepping onto a certain square causes some rogues to attack your hero. This time, though, there is no need to worry: you can easily handle these villains.

Once you have scattered them, head to the {magic {well}, where you can replenish the spell points you need to cast spells.

Let the wind keep howling higher,
let the water hiss in ire,
let the earth keep roaring still,
fire destroys it all at will!
